  @payload audio   := pending "media 미생성 — UBM-E4 후보 (audio encoder S-module 미-wired)"
  @payload video   := pending "media 미생성 — UBM-E4 후보 (만다라 형성 과정 영상)"
  # §57 tension @payload — PIPELINE-VALIDATION ONLY, NOT a perceptual ref.
  # E_tension is CLOSED-LOOP / ZERO-PERCEPTUAL-DIVERSITY (anima's own
  # Engine A/G state re-serialised through a fixed untrained map — §11-B
  # "physics != signal" in encoder form, carry §56 verdict). It validates
  # the e_tension -> Law-71 Ψ-box -> payload plumbing mechanically; it
  # adds zero new perceptual information and does NOT move §1.1/§51.
  # Ψ-coord here = E_tension closed-loop cloud centroid (the closed loop
